@startuml refund-state
title WF-06 | RefundStatus
hide empty description
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

[*] --> NONE : create payment
NONE --> REQUESTED : request [owner and eligible payment] / record reason
NONE --> APPROVED : approve [authorized exception] / apply refund hold
REQUESTED --> APPROVED : approve [eligible request or authorized exception]\n/ apply refund hold
REQUESTED --> REJECTED : reject [Admin authorized] / audit decision
APPROVED --> PROCESSING : submit [eligible VNPay refund, no prior request ID]\n/ reserve gateway request ID
APPROVED --> COMPLETED : confirm [valid manual transfer] / complete refund
PROCESSING --> COMPLETED : apply [verified successful full refund] / complete refund
PROCESSING --> GATEWAY_FAILED : apply [verified gateway failure] / record failure
PROCESSING --> PROCESSING : apply [outcome uncertain] / keep refund pending
GATEWAY_FAILED --> COMPLETED : confirm [valid manual transfer] / complete refund
REJECTED --> [*]
COMPLETED --> [*]

note right of COMPLETED
  In the same transaction, mark the payment REFUNDED,
  cancel the subscription and clear its refund hold.
end note
@enduml
